OL,4,CWildlife conservation cash targets ex- 
OL,5,Ccolliery sites                         
OL,6,GPonds are to be restored and           
OL,7,Gfreshwater habitats created for        
OL,8,Gamphibians and reptiles at two former  
OL,9,Gcolliery sites in South Yorkshire.     
OL,11,FThe Froglife charity has been awarded  
OL,12,Fnearly #890,000 of Lottery cash to     
OL,13,Fcarry out the work in Rother Valley,   
OL,14,Fas well as at sites in North and West  
OL,15,FYorkshire.                             
OL,17,FKiveton and Dinnington Community       
OL,18,FWoodlands were originally regenerated  
OL,19,Fthrough the National Coalfields        
OL,20,FProgramme after the pits there closed  
OL,21,Fin the 1990s.                          
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
