OL,4,CCancer patient waited two days in      
OL,5,Cchair, son says                        
OL,6,GThe son of an 83-year-old cancer       
OL,7,Gpatient says she spent almost two days 
OL,8,Gin a chair at A&E while waiting for a  
OL,9,Gbed in hospital.                       
OL,11,FNigel Wass says he had to bring his    
OL,12,Fmother fluids, turn off alarms and     
OL,13,Ffind a wheelchair to take her to the   
OL,14,Ftoilet during "close to 48 hours" at   
OL,15,FLincoln County Hospital, because staff 
OL,16,Fwere "run ragged".                     
OL,18,FOne in 20 patients using               
OL,19,FLincolnshire's emergency departments   
OL,20,Fwaited longer than 12 hours for a      
OL,21,Fhospital bed, according to NHS figures 
OL,22,Ffor the year to October.          G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
