OL,4,CSchool loses crossing patrols as       
OL,5,Capplicants dry up                      
OL,6,GA council says it is struggling to     
OL,7,Grecruit lollipop men and ladies after  
OL,8,Ga school lost all three of its         
OL,9,Gcrossing patrols.                      
OL,11,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council said  
OL,12,Fone in four crossing patrol sites were 
OL,13,Fcurrently unmanned and applicants were 
OL,14,F"dwindling".                           
OL,16,FAll Saints' Church of England          
OL,17,FFederation of Academies, a school in   
OL,18,FHessle, near Hull, has told parents it 
OL,19,Fwill be without patrols for the        
OL,20,Fforeseeable future.                    
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
