OL,4,CPub takes #100 in fake notes on        
OL,5,Copening weekend                        
OL,6,GA landlord says he was left feeling    
OL,7,Gshort-changed after taking #100 in     
OL,8,Gfake banknotes during his pub's        
OL,9,Gopening weekend.                       
OL,11,FThe Plough Boy on Burton Road, Lincoln 
OL,12,Freopened on 6 November after a change  
OL,13,Fin ownership and a renovation.         
OL,15,FLandlord Tommy Cooper said he          
OL,16,Fdiscovered the counterfeit currency    
OL,17,Fafter he felt part of a banknote       
OL,18,Fpeeling off when he rubbed it.         
OL,20,FHe said it was a "kick in the teeth"   
OL,21,Fwhen he discovered more fake cash in   
OL,22,Fthe till.                         G4/4 
